; @xors-software/* are private packages in the org's GitHub Packages registry.
; The Railway "server" service may build from this subdir, so the scope→registry
; mapping is duplicated here (mirrors ../.npmrc). Auth via NODE_AUTH_TOKEN — a
; GitHub token with read:packages, set as a variable on this Railway service.
@xors-software:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
